  "label": "Infantilizing Imagery",
  "description": "The visual of feet submerged in milk can be interpreted as infantilizing or demeaning, as it evokes imagery associated with babies or toddlers (e.g., bath time, milk baths). This requires cultural knowledge about how certain images are perceived as childish or gross.",
